; An assignment over an account that holds a zero amount with a cost: the zero keeps its row.

2026-01-01 a zero with a total cost, then an assignment
    a  0 X @@ 9 USD
    a  = -1.0 X
    z

2026-01-02 the same with a total-balance assertion
    b  0 X @@ 9 USD
    b  == -1 X
    z

2026-01-03 a zero with a unit cost is not kept
    c  0 X @ 9 USD
    c  = -1 X
    z

2026-01-04 a zero cost amount and another commodity
    d  0 X @@ 9 USD
    d  1 Z
    d  = -1 Y
    z

2026-01-05 every amount zero, the zero with a cost first
    e  0 X @@ 9 USD
    e  = 0 X
    z

2026-01-06 a written zero with places and a total cost is listed as 0
    f  0.00 USD @@ 1.00 AB
    g  0.0 AB
    h
